# Personal CMake presets. Machine-specific by definition, so never tracked -- a committed one with an
# absolute toolchain path breaks for everyone the moment that path changes. This repository shipped one
# naming E:/msys64/ucrt64, a drive that exists on no machine in the project, so every fresh clone got a
# pair of presets that could not configure. Start from CMakeUserPresets.json.example.
CMakeUserPresets.json
